<Layouts.app
  food_section={:recipes}
  food_context={@food_context}
  flash={@flash}
  show_header={false}
  main_class=""
  content_class=""
>
  <div class="food-page">
    <div class="w-full">
      <.kitchen_header
        title={@recipe.name}
        back={@back}
        back_label={@back_label}
        subtitle={"Základní dávka: #{Decimal.to_string(Decimal.normalize(@recipe.base_servings),:normal)} porcí · #{length(@recipe.lines)} surovin"}
      >
        <:actions>
          <.link
            id="edit-recipe"
            navigate={
              CozyCheckoutWeb.FoodNavigation.with_context(
                ~p"/admin/recipes/#{@recipe.id}/edit",
                @food_context
              )
            }
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-secondary-200 bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-500 hover:border-tertiary-300"
          ><.icon name="hero-pencil-square" class="h-4 w-4" />Upravit recept</.link>
        </:actions>
      </.kitchen_header>
      <p
        :if={@recipe.source_key == "kitchen:breakfast-buffet:v1"}
        id="buffet-estimate-label"
        class="mb-6 rounded-lg border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50 p-4 text-sm text-sky-950"
      >
        Normy tohoto bufetu jsou pracovní odhad pro první vyzkoušení. Můžete je upravit podle zkušenosti; nepoužívané suroviny nastavte na 0.
      </p>
      <div class="grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[20rem_1fr]">
        <aside class="space-y-5 lg:sticky lg:top-6">
          <section class="rounded-lg border border-secondary-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
            <span class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-secondary-50 p-3 text-tertiary-600"><.icon
              name="hero-calculator"
              class="h-6 w-6"
            /></span><h2 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold text-primary-500">
              Pro kolik lidí vaříte?
            </h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary-400">
              Upravte počty. Suroviny se ihned přepočítají pro celou skupinu.
            </p>
            <.form
              for={@calculator}
              id="recipe-calculator"
              phx-change="calculate"
              class="mt-5 space-y-4"
            >
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <.input
                  field={@calculator[:adults]}
                  type="number"
                  min="0"
                  step="1"
                  label="Dospělí"
                  class={field_class()}
                /><.input
                  field={@calculator[:children]}
                  type="number"
                  min="0"
                  step="1"
                  label="Děti"
                  class={field_class()}
                />
              </div><.input
                field={@calculator[:percent]}
                type="number"
                min="0"
                max="100"
                step="any"
                label="Dětská porce (% dospělé)"
                class={field_class()}
              /><p :if={@error} id="calculator-error" class="text-sm text-red-700">{@error}</p>
            </.form>
            <div class="mt-5 rounded-lg bg-secondary-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-tertiary-600">
                Připravíte
              </p><p id="actual-portions" class="mt-1 text-3xl font-bold text-primary-500">
                {@result.actual} <span class="text-base font-medium">porcí</span>
              </p><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-primary-500">
                Dětský koeficient upravuje množství surovin, nikoliv počet vydaných porcí.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>
          <section
            :if={@recipe.source_reference || @recipe.notes}
            class="rounded-lg border border-secondary-200 bg-white p-5"
          >
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-primary-500">Zdroj a poznámky</h2>
            <p
              :if={@recipe.source_reference && is_nil(CozyCheckout.Recipes.source_url(@recipe))}
              id="recipe-source-attribution"
              class="mt-3 text-sm text-primary-400"
            >
              {@recipe.source_reference}
            </p><p
              :if={@recipe.notes}
              class="mt-3 whitespace-pre-line text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary-400"
            >
              {@recipe.notes}
            </p><a
              :if={CozyCheckout.Recipes.source_url(@recipe)}
              href={CozyCheckout.Recipes.source_url(@recipe)}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-tertiary-600"
            >Původní recept <.icon name="hero-arrow-top-right-on-square" class="h-4 w-4" /></a>
          </section>
        </aside>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <section
            id="recipe-portion-costs"
            class="space-y-3 rounded-lg border border-secondary-200 bg-white p-5"
          >
            <h2 class="font-bold">Aktuální kalkulované náklady na suroviny na porci</h2>
            <p class="text-sm">
              Podle současné receptury a cen včetně DPH k dnešnímu dni. Bez práce, energií a odpadu.
            </p>
            <div :for={{label, costs} <- @portion_costs} class="border-t pt-3">
              <p class="font-semibold">
                {label} · dětský koeficient {CozyCheckoutWeb.CurrencyHelper.format_number(
                  costs.child.factor
                )}
              </p>
              <p>
                Dospělá porce: {CozyCheckoutWeb.CurrencyHelper.format_currency(
                  costs.adult.known_total
                )} · dětská porce: {CozyCheckoutWeb.CurrencyHelper.format_currency(
                  costs.child.known_total
                )}
              </p>
              <p
                :if={!costs.adult.complete? or !costs.child.complete?}
                class="font-semibold text-amber-800"
              >
                Neúplná kalkulace — zobrazen je pouze známý mezisoučet.
              </p>
              <p :for={issue <- costs.adult.issues} class="text-sm text-amber-800">{issue}</p>
            </div>
            <.link navigate={~p"/admin/kitchen-costs/prices"} class="text-tertiary-700">Doplnit ceny a historii surovin</.link>
          </section>
          <.consumption_table result={@result} />
          <details class="rounded-lg border border-secondary-200 bg-white p-5">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-semibold text-primary-500">
              Původní dávka a poznámky k surovinám
            </summary><div id="recipe-source-lines" class="mt-4 divide-y divide-secondary-200">
              <div :for={line <- @recipe.lines} class="py-3">
                <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 text-sm">
                  <span class="font-medium text-primary-500">{line.ingredient.name}</span><span class="font-semibold text-primary-500">{CozyCheckout.Recipes.format_quantity(
                    line.quantity,
                    line.unit
                  )}</span>
                </div><p :if={line.notes} class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-primary-400">
                  {line.notes}
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layouts.app>
